      "content": "Hearing that you believe you are unlovable and a permanent burden to others is incredibly painful, but it is important to remember that the way you carry yourself and your self-perception can often be a self-fulfilling cycle. \"Toxic\" is a heavy label for a person to accept, and many people struggle with overcoming the deep harm they caused before they can feel better. You deserve to be given a chance to seek help and grow, even if you feel unworthy of it yourself.",
